OL,3,ADeath toll from Philippines ferry fire
OL,4,Arises to 76, with more still missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Philippine Coast Guard says it has
OL,7,Frecovered 41 bodies from the wreckage
OL,8,Fof a ferry that caught fire this week,
OL,9,Fbringing the total death toll to 76.
OL,11,FMore than 130 people were on board the
OL,12,FMV June Aster when the blaze erupted on
OL,13,FWednesday as it neared its destination
OL,14,Fat the tourist hotspot of Coron, after
OL,15,Fdeparting from Manila.
OL,17,FThe coast guard said on Saturday the
OL,18,Fnumber of survivors remained 43, with
OL,19,Fmany receiving treatment in hospital,
OL,20,Fbut 13 people remain unaccounted for.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
