OL,3,ADeath toll from Philippines ferry fire
OL,4,Arises to 76, with more still missing
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecovery of bodies had been hampered
OL,7,Fdue to toxic fumes and lingering heat,
OL,8,Fwhich meant authorities were unable to
OL,9,Fboard until Friday.
